#EXTM3U
#PLAYLIST:MusicV
# Remote MusicV set. Silky's MUSICV_2.COM OPL3 sequencer (`.wm` / `.m`).
# Root `.wm` files from AdPlug's format-library zip. GitHub Pages serves
# the zip, not members, so the player fetches MusicV.zip and unpacks.
# Archive.org-style hosts that already unpack `.zip/` still work as-is.
# Modland has no MusicV folder.

